  "description": "Application under Section 73 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 to vary condition 1 of planning permission 24/00653/FULLR3 dated 16/08/2024 to extend the temporary time period for the installation of the sculptures to 20/07/2027.\r\rCondition Number(s): 1 The sculptures and plinths authorised by this permission must be removed by 20 July 2026\rand unless otherwise approved, the works required for the reinstatement of the land to its\rcondition existing before the development must be carried out by the same date.\rREASON: In accordance with the applicant's request for a limited period consent and to\rensure that the visual amenities of the area are not prejudiced when the sculpture and\rassociated structures are removed in accordance with the following policies of the Local\rPlan: CS10; DM 10.4.\r\r2 The development shall not be carried out other than in accordance with the following\rapproved drawings and particulars or as approved under conditions of this planning\rpermission: Julian Opie SITC 1:1250 Rev 1, Julian Opie SITC 1:140 Rev 1.\rREASON: To ensure that the development of this site is in compliance with details and\rparticulars which have been approved by the Local Planning Authority. \r\rConditions(s) Removal:\r\rChange to Condition 1 to allow existing artworks to be displayed for a further year, for more public engagement\rExtension of planning permission until July 2027",
